      "description": "SHOP M&S WITH EASE\n\nMake shopping for your favourite M&S products easier than ever, whether you're at home, on the go, or in store, with the M&S app.\n\nFrom gift ideas to the latest fashion, home, and beauty finds, shop across all your essentials and make every purchase more rewarding with your digital Sparks loyalty card.\n\nWith Sparks you’ll unlock exclusive offers, birthday treats and much more.\n\nBrowse thousands of food products, check prices, discover the latest Dine In menus, check availability, and be the first to find out what’s new.\n\n\nSHOP ACROSS YOUR FAVOURITE CATEGORIES\n\nFrom fashion to food, shop with ease across our bestselling categories:\n\n- Womenswear, lingerie, menswear, & kidswear\n- School uniform\n- Beauty & skincare\n- Homeware & furniture\n- Flowers, hampers, food & wine\n- Seasonal offers & sales\n\n\nGET MORE FROM M&S WITH SPARKS\n\n- Personalised Sparks offers tailored to you\n- Free birthday treat\n- Charity donations every time you shop\n- Perks for new parents with The Parent hood club\n- Get e-receipts emailed after shopping in store\n\n\nBROWSE M&S FOOD IN-STORE PRODUCTS\n\n- Check stock & price in your local Foodhall\n- See what’s new every week\n- Plan your shop with our digital shopping list\n\n\nWHY CHOOSE M&S?\n\n- Effortless online shopping\n- Free nominated-day flower delivery*\n- Free to Click & Collect in your chosen store\n- Order tracking on all purchases\n- Easy paperless returns\n- Digital receipts when shopping in store*\n- Exclusive Sparks loyalty rewards and personalised offers\n\n\nENHANCED IN-STORE EXPERIENCE\n\nShopping in store and want something in a different size, colour, or style? Scan the barcode and order for delivery to your home or nearest M&S.\n\n\nGET INSPIRED\n\nBrowse our features and articles to get the latest advice, trends and tips on fashion, food, beauty, and entertaining.\n\n\nM&S RECIPES\n\nDiscover hundreds of exclusive recipes made with the best M&S ingredients. Save your favourites to your personal cookbook and create your shopping list in one click.\n\n\nFIND US\n\nLooking for your nearest M&S store? Use the store finder to get directions and quickly locate your nearest M&S.\n\n\nDOWNLOAD NOW\n\nDownload the free M&S app and enjoy smarter shopping today.\n\n\nFOLLOW US\n\nFollow M&S on social media and stay updated with the latest news, offers and sale updates:\n\nFacebook: @marksandspencer\nInstagram: @marksandspencer @marksandspencerfood @marksandspencerstyle\nX: @marksandspencer\nPinterest: @marksandspencer\nTikTok: @mandsfood\n\n\nVisit: www.marksandspencer.com\n\n*Terms, conditions and exclusions may apply. See www.marksandspencer.com for details.",
